maluos-agent (0.2.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Ownership (Phase 12 slice 3): `--owner user:NAME` (default: the sudo
    user when enrolled; `--owner none` for a system agent). Recorded in
    the registry maluos_agent (maluos-vault 0.3.0 schema) and as
    MALUOS_AGENT_OWNER in the agent's env file; a polkit rule in
    /etc/polkit-1/rules.d lets the owner's session start, stop and restart
    the unit. list and show print the owner; remove retires the row and the
    rule.

